name: sim.subtractObjectFromOctree
description: Removes an object from an OC tree, as voxel subtractions
luaSynopsis: int totalVoxelCnt = sim.subtractObjectFromOctree(int octreeHandle, int objectHandle, int options)
pythonSynopsis: int totalVoxelCnt = sim.subtractObjectFromOctree(int octreeHandle, int objectHandle, int options)
inputs:
1. octreeHandle: handle of the OC tree
2. objectHandle: handle of the object to subtract. Only potentially collidable objects are supported
3. options: reserved. Set to 0
outputs:
1. totalVoxelCnt: total number of voxels in the OC tree
